<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1388] Platform .Net: cache.Invoke result in async mode should have an error flag</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1388</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In async mode we either write a result directly, or use EntryProcessorExceptionWriter in case of an error. It is impossible to discern an error from good result on the receiving end. Need to write a flag first.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12862376">IGNITE-1388</key>
